data: {"id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2-thinking-parallel_evidence-147", "run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将根据已完成的 Prometheus/Metrics 和 Logging/Tracing 预采集结果，继续执行证据计划中的 Kubernetes 部分。\n\n1. `kubectl_describe`: 确认当前状态、Last State、Exit Code、重启历史。\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml`: 确认 command/args、image、resources、probes 配置。\n3. `kubectl_previous_logs`: 获取上一次崩溃容器的日志。\n4. `kubectl_events`: 获取 Pod 相关事件（OOMKilled, Killing, Liveness probe failed 等）。\n\n开始执行。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789076468619, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

