data: {"id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2-thinking-parallel_evidence-641", "run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实与缺口说明：\n\n**当前 Pod 身份与生命周期**\n*   **确认身份**：Pod `workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` (UID: `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`) 处于 `aiops-case-07` 命名空间，运行在 `node2` 上。\n*   **状态**：Pod 阶段为 `Running`，但处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 循环中。\n*   **重启情况**：容器 `app` 已经重启了 18 次，退出码为 `78`，最新的 Back-off 等待时间为 5m0s。\n\n**关键诊断事实（支持 CrashLoopBackOff 原因）**\n*   **直接原因**：Previous Logs 明确显示容器在崩溃前最后一次执行了 Python 服务 `server.py`，在处理 HTTP 请求 `/work` 时抛出了 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（HTTP 500），并伴随 `allocated_mib: 0` 的异常资源指标（可能暗示内存或配置未分配导致立即崩溃）。\n*   ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789076500828, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "seq": 642, "ts_ms": 1789076509462, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 65.83, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-07", "name": "workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/a16b16cbc7de4cb2-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "37a583ed294d28cb415f1207c2535111455712d99d3b6342e4932a8cb41957db", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "cd2f4dbb39654265c7c7e87997b2eccb55dd7895c8e0e723b2b6cddc55eb22f8"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "seq": 643, "ts_ms": 1789076509463, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "seq": 644, "ts_ms": 1789076517393, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.93, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1428, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器反复重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff, last_exit_code=78 | 确认应用容器持续异常退出，触发 K8s 重启保护机制 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning BackOff 45s (x310 over 70m) restarting failed container app | 确认该重启循环已持续约 70 分钟，属于长期故障 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | log.message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\" | 指出进程终止的具体原因是运行时配置缺失 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow + Tempo | l7_flow: GET /work -> HTTP 500 (9 occurrences); span: observed_mode=config_missing_exit | 关联具体请求路径与日志错误，证实服务在收到请求并发现配置缺失时主动崩溃 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=18 | 量化重启次数，与 K8s restart_count 一致，排除监控盲区 |\n\n**证据说明**\n- **编号 1、2、5** 相互印证，从状态、事件和时序指标三个维度锁定了“CrashLoopBackOff”这一持续发生的症状。\n- **编号 3（日志）** 提供了最直接的终止原因线索 `CONFIG_MISSING`。\n- **编号 4（链路）** 将 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误精准定位到了具体的业务请求 `/work`，并确认了服务处理该请求后的行为模式。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码在初始化或请求 /work 时检测到 CONFIG_MISSING → 抛出 500 异常并主动终止进程(Exit Code 78) → kubelet 检测到容器退出并触发重启循环 → 用户观察到 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**应用代码逻辑缺陷导致的运行时配置缺失**。\n\n具体而言，应用在处理 `GET /work` 请求时因检测到关键配置项缺失（日志确认 `CONFIG_MISSING`），进而抛出异常并主动终止进程。这一明确的代码级错误直接导致了容器的反复崩溃与重启，是造成 Pod CrashLoopBackOff 的唯一决定性原因。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器反复重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff, last_exit_code=78 | 确认应用容器持续异常退出，触发 K8s 重启保护机制 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning BackOff 45s (x310 over 70m) restarting failed container app | 确认该重启循环已持续约 70 分钟，属于长期故障 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | log.message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\" | 指出进程终止的具体原因是运行时配置缺失 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow + Tempo | l7_flow: GET /work -> HTTP 500 (9 occurrences); span: observed_mode=config_missing_exit | 关联具体请求路径与日志错误，证实服务在收到请求并发现配置缺失时主动崩溃 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=18 | 量化重启次数，与 K8s restart_count 一致，排除监控盲区 |\n\n**证据说明**\n- **编号 1、2、5** 相互印证，从状态、事件和时序指标三个维度锁定了“CrashLoopBackOff”这一持续发生的症状。\n- **编号 3（日志）** 提供了最直接的终止原因线索 `CONFIG_MISSING`。\n- **编号 4（链路）** 将 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误精准定位到了具体的业务请求 `/work`，并确认了服务处理该请求后的行为模式。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码在初始化或请求 /work 时检测到 CONFIG_MISSING → 抛出 500 异常并主动终止进程(Exit Code 78) → kubelet 检测到容器退出并触发重启循环 → 用户观察到 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**应用代码逻辑缺陷导致的运行时配置缺失**。\n\n具体而言，应用在处理 `GET /work` 请求时因检测到关键配置项缺失（日志确认 `CONFIG_MISSING`），进而抛出异常并主动终止进程。这一明确的代码级错误直接导致了容器的反复崩溃与重启，是造成 Pod CrashLoopBackOff 的唯一决定性原因。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2-final", "run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "seq": 646, "ts_ms": 1789076517402, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器反复重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff, last_exit_code=78 | 确认应用容器持续异常退出，触发 K8s 重启保护机制 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning BackOff 45s (x310 over 70m) restarting failed container app | 确认该重启循环已持续约 70 分钟，属于长期故障 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | log.message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\" | 指出进程终止的具体原因是运行时配置缺失 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow + Tempo | l7_flow: GET /work -> HTTP 500 (9 occurrences); span: observed_mode=config_missing_exit | 关联具体请求路径与日志错误，证实服务在收到请求并发现配置缺失时主动崩溃 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=18 | 量化重启次数，与 K8s restart_count 一致，排除监控盲区 |\n\n**证据说明**\n- **编号 1、2、5** 相互印证，从状态、事件和时序指标三个维度锁定了“CrashLoopBackOff”这一持续发生的症状。\n- **编号 3（日志）** 提供了最直接的终止原因线索 `CONFIG_MISSING`。\n- **编号 4（链路）** 将 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误精准定位到了具体的业务请求 `/work`，并确认了服务处理该请求后的行为模式。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码在初始化或请求 /work 时检测到 CONFIG_MISSING → 抛出 500 异常并主动终止进程(Exit Code 78) → kubelet 检测到容器退出并触发重启循环 → 用户观察到 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**应用代码逻辑缺陷导致的运行时配置缺失**。\n\n具体而言，应用在处理 `GET /work` 请求时因检测到关键配置项缺失（日志确认 `CONFIG_MISSING`），进而抛出异常并主动终止进程。这一明确的代码级错误直接导致了容器的反复崩溃与重启，是造成 Pod CrashLoopBackOff 的唯一决定性原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 65.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 65.8s (Evidence 57.3s, RCA 8.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 88.946, "metrics": {"run_id": "a16b16cbc7de4cb2", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 88.95451331138611, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 88954.51331138611, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 60276.54933929443, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 34854.302406311035, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 28282.371759414673}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15172.943592071533, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 65829.8532962799, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms